                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3caaf8e5-a665-3bdf-ad02-784bb0ae2340",
                        "entry_id": "ac7a1336-181e-330a-ac96-0607f9ed4117",
                        "glosses": [
                            "филол. фигура речи, состоящая в комическом или образном сближении слов, которые вследствие сходства в звучании и частичного совпадения морфемного состава могут иногда ошибочно, но чаще каламбурно использоваться в речи"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "935b62eb-007b-45e7-829f-09eed6383d54",
                        "source_entry_id": "ac7a1336-181e-330a-ac96-0607f9ed4117",
                        "source_sense_id": "3caaf8e5-a665-3bdf-ad02-784bb0ae2340",
                        "target_lang_word": "paronomasia",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "paronomasia",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "76064f4a-0163-3ac8-8aaa-c78437388a49",
                                        "entry_id": "dbd12154-92d3-3316-8eaf-9234984f3b97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A pun or play on words."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "rhetoric",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e837daf8-bc48-4b23-b041-ba1df61f794f",
                                                "sense_id": "76064f4a-0163-3ac8-8aaa-c78437388a49",
                                                "text": "Oh, by the way, any attempt to present me with any kind of testimonial will result in stern measures.\nAnd when I say stern measures, I am indulging in a paronomasia, or play on words! Good night."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee876709-07de-4757-9add-d51e0927acf5",
                                                "sense_id": "76064f4a-0163-3ac8-8aaa-c78437388a49",
                                                "text": "Ev’rywhere but at Norfolk, where talk of Passion far outweighs its Enactment,– indeed, the Sailors’ paronomasia for that wretched Place,\nis ‘No-Fuck’."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9c0049c5-f31e-33c3-ad42-f71e25710ee9",
                                        "entry_id": "dbd12154-92d3-3316-8eaf-9234984f3b97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The use of puns."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "rhetoric",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "343ce377-2454-47dd-926e-6e580253b2e6",
                                                "sense_id": "9c0049c5-f31e-33c3-ad42-f71e25710ee9",
                                                "text": "Paronomasia to the sense alludes,\nWhen words but little varied it includes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d6f256fc-5fe0-4383-9650-9f2ce99e5255",
                                                "sense_id": "9c0049c5-f31e-33c3-ad42-f71e25710ee9",
                                                "text": "[…] he gloomily regarded his new digital watch, faintly fascinated by the onward march of the square figures\nwhich turned one into the other with insolent ease, a kind of numerical paronomasia."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "aed3aec7-d0e1-43e4-993e-0819624d89ad",
                        "source_entry_id": "ac7a1336-181e-330a-ac96-0607f9ed4117",
                        "source_sense_id": "3caaf8e5-a665-3bdf-ad02-784bb0ae2340",
                        "target_lang_word": "paronomasia",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "paronomasia",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d0844b2d-918c-351f-a1f4-f56050f25d4c",
                                        "entry_id": "2bf8b9c5-815a-34f6-be53-80e6bc659512",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tipo de similitud entre el sonido de un conjunto de palabras o vocablos, que solamente se diferencian por la vocal que tiene el acento prosódico."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9bad0eb7-c072-43f6-96b3-8e7d0ac63baa",
                                                "sense_id": "d0844b2d-918c-351f-a1f4-f56050f25d4c",
                                                "text": "hay paronomasia entre \"caso\", \"queso\", \"quiso\", \"coso\" y \"cuso."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f7b9f039-0a55-3ee2-a46f-554b3f9ddc58",
                                        "entry_id": "2bf8b9c5-815a-34f6-be53-80e6bc659512",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "En general, similitud o semejanza en la forma entre dos o más palabras."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d7d589d-e2b6-48a7-8bea-25024f81001e",
                                                "sense_id": "f7b9f039-0a55-3ee2-a46f-554b3f9ddc58",
                                                "text": "hay paronomasia entre \"hombre\", \"hombro\" y \"hambre\", como también entre \"Marte\", \"martes\" y \"mártir\"."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "640122a5-1213-3e18-b288-6b3047a52c77",
                                        "entry_id": "2bf8b9c5-815a-34f6-be53-80e6bc659512",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Grupo de palabras o vocablos que tienen estos tipos de similitud_(1, 2)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0eb83dfb-9c67-3187-8e06-6eea8dd3f68a",
                                        "entry_id": "2bf8b9c5-815a-34f6-be53-80e6bc659512",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Figura o juego de palabras que consiste en combinar dentro de una frase o un párrafo vocablos con sonido similar pero significado diferente."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "retórica"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b9472bf-7ceb-42a4-af01-2f6f81d70afe",
                                                "sense_id": "0eb83dfb-9c67-3187-8e06-6eea8dd3f68a",
                                                "text": "El poeta Octavio Paz crea numerosas paronomasias en su libro Libertad bajo palabra (1949), por ejemplo: \"El erizo se irisa, se eriza, se riza de risa\"."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"4\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
